Station T-03 in survey area T consists of a four-layer sequence with resistivity values increasing continuously with depth. The sequence starts with a layer of 177.8 $\Omega\cdot\text{m}$ (0–13.27m), followed by 265.8 $\Omega\cdot\text{m}$ (13.27–16.67m), 1064.5 $\Omega\cdot\text{m}$ (16.67–25.48m), and a fourth layer of 2584.7 $\Omega\cdot\text{m}$ below 25.48m.

Please note that the on-file classification of HA-type is incorrect. Based on the interpreted layer resistivities, where $r_1 < r_2 < r_3 < r_4$, the curve follows a strictly increasing trend. Therefore, the correct curve type is A.

